/></highlight
><highlight color="#9643FC" opacity="0.399994" creationdate="D:20250624111116+10'00'" flags="print" IT="HighlightNote" date="D:20250624111132+10'00'" name="8cd7ab1b-ff27-40b1-805c-526b96e707dd" page="4" coords="375.540000,108.892000,549.640000,108.892000,375.540000,93.802300,549.640000,93.802300,306.850000,95.892200,549.659000,95.892200,306.850000,80.802300,549.659000,80.802300,306.850000,82.892200,549.631000,82.892200,306.850000,67.802300,549.631000,67.802300,306.850000,69.892200,549.639000,69.892200,306.850000,54.802300,549.639000,54.802300,306.850000,56.892200,549.631000,56.892200,306.850000,41.802300,549.631000,41.802300" rect="306.379000,41.330700,550.130000,109.364000" subject="Comment on Text" title="alexd"
><contents-richtext
><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:25.1.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"
><p dir="ltr"
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-14.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>14c: </span
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-13.3pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>The main finding is that normalized passive&#xD;drag has a strong, negative association with 100 m freestyle&#xD;race speed in Para swimmers with physical impairment. In&#xD;other words, Para swimmers that have lower passive drag relative&#xD;to their body mass also tend to have faster times in the </span
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-13.3pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>100 m freestyle. However, linear regression showed that type&#xD;of physical impairment influenced the relationship between&#xD;passive drag and 100 m freestyle race performance. These&#xD;findings suggest that passive drag is a determinant of performance&#xD;and can be used to provide an objective assessment of&#xD;activity limitation in Para swimmers with physical impairments&#xD;although it is important to consider the type of physical&#xD;impairment when applying results to guide classification.</span
></p
></body
></contents-richtext
><popup flags="print,nozoom,norotate" open="no" page="4" rect="595.276000,16.892200,779.276000,108.892000"
/></highlight
